1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,200
Add your first item. A photo of the item on your device. About 2 minutes.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:15,600
Open Add Item. In your Vault, choose ADD ITEM.

3
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:26,100
Choose Manual entry. Pick Manual entry to type the details yourself.

4
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:36,600
Add a photo. Upload a photo from your device. It appears in the photo strip.

5
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:47,100
Name your item. Type a title. The form shows Ready to save.

6
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:57,600
Choose a category and add details. Pick a Universe and Category. Series, purchase price and current value are optional.

7
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:08,100
Save. Choose Save. You will see a green Saved! banner.

8
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:18,600
Find it in your Vault. Your item is in the Vault with its photo, category and value.

9
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:29,100
Open it any time. Open the item to see its photo, details, value and gain.

10
00:01:30,100 --> 00:01:36,000
Your first item is saved to your Vault. Next: build an exhibition from your items.
